# Project 2501 - 'pm' (Puppet Master)

A fast, keyboard-first TUI web browser that slips through the noise and pulls the signal. Inspired by vi.

Tech Stack
--------

Go (highest compatible version w/ 9front)
modernc.org/quickjs (quickjs lib)
charmbracelet/bubbletea (tui lib)
golang.org/x/net/html (html parser)
tdewolff/parse/css (css parser)
rsc.io/script (script-based test cases)
golang.org/x/tools/txtar (trivial text-based file archive format)
spf13/cobra (cli)
spf13/viper (config)
